The NEON character-classification tables in vector_arm64.go and
vector_tinygo.c and the structured load/store algorithms in vector_tinygo.c
are adapted from simdutf's src/arm64/arm_base64.cpp:
https://github.com/simdutf/simdutf/blob/master/src/arm64/arm_base64.cpp

Copyright 2020 The simdutf authors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; see ../../LICENSE.

The adapted tables reject control characters and spaces in the vector
classifier, and reject standard-alphabet punctuation in the URL alphabet.
CR/LF are handled separately to preserve Go's encoding/base64 semantics.
